    "final": "I opened all 45 tee listings found for 'Wexcombe' (36 on page 1 + 9 on page 2; every result was a Wexcombe tee, so no non-tee listings were excluded). On each opened listing I checked the Size options and, where size M was selectable, selected M and read the actual updated price and stock state. 23 of the 45 sellers cannot supply size M at all (M absent from the size list or disabled): Fairhaven Apparel, Foxcombe Threads, Whitlock Outfitters, Oakfield Textile Company, Gisburn Garments, Westmere Textile Company, Kelsall Textile Company, Holbeck Clothing Company Ltd, Dovercourt Apparel, Fenwick Threads, Haldane Apparel, Everleigh Garments, Stonebridge Workwear Supply Co, Redhill Uniform Supply, Kettering Apparel, Copperfield Workwear Supply Co, Marchmont Textiles Official Store, Oakhurst Textile Company, Ingleton Apparel Official Store, Ambleside Garment Works, Ashgrove Workwear Supply Co, Abbotsley Apparel Official Store, Elmsworth Textiles Official Store. The three cheapest sellers that can actually supply size M (M in stock, Add to Cart enabled, price confirmed after selecting M) are: 1) Carnforth Textile Company at $13.02 (http://localhost:7770/igr-tcl-24.html), 2) Dalston Textiles Official Store at $14.48 (http://localhost:7770/igr-tcl-02.html), 3) Dunmore Outfitters at $16.30 (http://localhost:7770/igr-tcl-25.html). Note the search-result 'as low as' prices were unreliable: e.g. the cheapest-looking listing (Dovercourt Apparel, $10.13) has no M option, Carnforth shows $11.38 but M is $13.02, and Dalston shows $12.85 but M is $14.48.",
